{"after":{"description":"Priority: P2 | Area: package | Labels: fix,P2,area:package | Milestone: v0.0.30 | RFC: OQ-PACKAGING | Task: CTX-1583

`packaging/bitty.spec` still defaults `%{!?version:...}` to 0.0.27 and its %changelog entry is 0.0.27, so a plain manual `rpmbuild -bs` produces a 0.0.27 SRPM after the 0.0.29 release. Single-source the default to the released version, refresh the changelog entry, declare `ExclusiveArch: x86_64 aarch64` because only those bundles exist, and update the release-channels regression guard to assert the new default. Keep the version-overridable contract used by the release and repair workflows.","priority":"normal","required_role":"backend","title":"[0.0.30] Refresh the RPM spec default version and archive scope"},"before":{"description":"Priority: P2 | Area: package | Labels: fix,P2,area:package | Milestone: v0.0.30 | RFC: OQ-PACKAGING | Task: assign display id

